{"at":"2026-10-13T12:38:33.274Z","tool":"save_changes","args":"{\"issue\":11404,\"content\":\"Scope: italic text (issue #11404) on desktop Chrome, Firefox and Safari, plus the mobile layout at 375 px wide; shortcuts are given for Windows/Linux with the macOS key in brackets.\\n\\n# Text properties\\n\\n## C-001 Font family: changing the font of a text element\\nAction: u","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:38:38.181Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"Italic is one property of the whole text element, turned on and off by an \\\"Italic\\\" toggle in the properties panel (tooltip \\\"Italic (Ctrl+I)\\\") and by Ctrl+I (Cmd+I on macOS); there is no partial italic, no separate italic font, and bold is out of scope.\",\"source\"","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:38:39.883Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"Italic works with every font, using a synthetic slant where a font has no italic face, and italic text stays readable and unclipped in Latin, Cyrillic, Chinese, Japanese, Arabic, Hebrew, emoji and mixed scripts with direction and alignment unchanged.\",\"source\":\"Prod","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:38:41.185Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"The last chosen italic value becomes the default for new text, and changing the color or opacity of an italic text keeps it italic.\",\"source\":\"Product owner answers 7 and 14 in the issue 11404 session, 2026-10-13, approved by the user\",\"issue\":11404}","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:38:42.837Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"The \\\"Italic\\\" toggle is shown when a text, a shape with text, an arrow with a label or a sticky note is selected, or the Text tool is active; with several texts of mixed italic it shows as not pressed, and one click makes all italic, a second click removes italic f","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:38:44.436Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"files-and-export\",\"fact\":\"Italic survives a page reload, a saved .excalidraw file, PNG and SVG export, copy as PNG/SVG and live collaboration; an older Excalidraw version opens a file with italic text without error and shows it upright.\",\"source\":\"Approved answer 11 (accepted suggestion) in","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:38:45.734Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"styles-and-history\",\"fact\":\"Paste styles, Ctrl+C then Ctrl+V, Ctrl+D, Alt+drag and library items carry a text's italic, and one italic change is undone with a single undo and restored with a single redo.\",\"source\":\"Approved answer 10 (accepted suggestion) in the issue 11404 session, 2026-10","outcome":"ok"}
